**/generated/

# ─── iOS build / generated (signing material is in the 🍏 block above) ─────
**/ios/Pods/
**/ios/.symlinks/
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.framework
**/ios/Flutter/Flutter.podspec
**/ios/Flutter/Generated.xcconfig
